  "body": "Property highlights:\r\n• Spacious 370m² floor plan – perfect for families or multi-generational living\r\n• Large 1,030m² freehold section – plenty of outdoor space\r\n• Beautifully seaviews and well-maintained throughout\r\n• Prime location with excellent school zones\r\n• This is a genuine must-sell situation – don't miss your chance. Bring your offer today.\r\n\r\nThis elegant, high-quality, and thoughtfully designed family home is perfectly positioned in the heart of Murrays Bay. Boasting expansive sea views and access to some of the North Shore's most sought-after school zones, this exceptional residence stands out in one of the area's most desirable seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nSet on an elevated, sun-filled site with stunning sea views, the home is spacious, light-filled, and designed for modern family living. Generous open-plan living areas flow seamlessly to the outdoor entertaining deck, creating the perfect setting for relaxing and hosting family and friends.\r\n\r\nSolidly built and beautifully presented, the home features three spacious living areas, a designer kitchen complete with an impressive scullery, six generous bedrooms, a separate study, and 3.5 bathrooms, including a luxurious master ensuite. A single garage, additional parking space, and ample off-street parking provide everyday convenience. From the sparkling swimming pool to the expansive decking, every aspect of this remarkable home has been designed to embrace outdoor living while making the most of its breathtaking surroundings.\r\n\r\nA supersized entertaining lounge on the lower level, along with its own bathroom and two generous bedrooms, provides exceptional flexibility. This versatile space is ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers, flatmates, or a private home office retreat. An open-plan, family-focused layout with this level of space and versatility is hard to find.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the highly desirable school zoning for Murrays Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Rangitoto College. The superb location is equally impressive, just moments from local shopping, cafés, beautiful beaches, and the popular Bays, offering an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe perfect family haven! This is a rare opportunity to secure an outstanding family home in a premium coastal location. Don't miss your chance to make this exceptional property yours.",
